32.poster.avif?t=1752771876\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5d53f7f18a998fc62246686554c3d832.webm?t=1752771876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592220/extras/5d53f7f18a998fc62246686554c3d832.mp4?t=1752771876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>They don\u2019t like you very much.  Kill them I guess.</p>",
